    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth, ravaged by nuclear war, has become a battleground for an alien invasion. As humanity\u2019s last hope, you\u2019ll need  to plow through enemy lines and reclaim our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive mazes filled with deadly traps, face off against alien bosses, and eliminate anything that crawls or flies in your path to bring Earth back from the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keyboard to move and mouse to aim and fire to navigate this intense 2.5D platformer inspired by the thrill of 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by solo creator <i>Horizont Games, this game </i>combines fast-paced, modern gameplay with vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Run and jump with the keyboard, aim and shoot with the mouse\u2014intuitive controls that keep you focused on the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/12d1209a10ef07de57374991d102e54a.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Annihilation</strong>: Battle deadly alien enemies and tactical drones that will put your reflexes and strategy to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/95b15ae3cc248c03411448a5100fbfee.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong>: Confront massive alien commanders that demand skill, timing, and sharp thinking to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/e7c8ef033290e765a0ae483b3591358e.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System of Keys:</strong> Find the right keys to let you proceed in the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/1a11fd4c3fc21b3e089db8653cd4eb44.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Energy Infusions</strong>: Discover boosts and new weapons to enhance your abilities and overpower enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/5e2b80089c9f7c9ae335bcdfb86b62e0.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to reclaim Earth, one battle at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth, ravaged by nuclear war, has become a battleground for an alien invasion. As humanity\u2019s last hope, you\u2019ll need  to plow through enemy lines and reclaim our planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive mazes filled with deadly traps, face off against alien bosses, and eliminate anything that crawls or flies in your path to bring Earth back from the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keyboard to move and mouse to aim and fire to navigate this intense 2.5D platformer inspired by the thrill of 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by solo creator <i>Horizont Games, this game </i>combines fast-paced, modern gameplay with vibrant visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Run and jump with the keyboard, aim and shoot with the mouse\u2014intuitive controls that keep you focused on the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/12d1209a10ef07de57374991d102e54a.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Annihilation</strong>: Battle deadly alien enemies and tactical drones that will put your reflexes and strategy to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/95b15ae3cc248c03411448a5100fbfee.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong>: Confront massive alien commanders that demand skill, timing, and sharp thinking to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/e7c8ef033290e765a0ae483b3591358e.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System of Keys:</strong> Find the right keys to let you proceed in the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/1a11fd4c3fc21b3e089db8653cd4eb44.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Energy Infusions</strong>: Discover boosts and new weapons to enhance your abilities and overpower enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342480/extras/5e2b80089c9f7c9ae335bcdfb86b62e0.avif?t=1741288189\" width=246 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to reclaim Earth, one battle at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "This 2.5d platformer blends the nostalgia of 90s shooters with modern gameplay mechanics and graphic design. Move using the keyboard, aim and fire with the mouse, kill everything that crawls of flies, get through mazes full of deadly traps, survive battles with robotic bosses and save the Earth.",
